<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian zone group one qualifying matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia 4 Bangladesh 1 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia - Khalid al-Mowalad 20, Khalid al-Temawi 25, Ibrahim al-Shahrani 65, Fahad Mehalel 73</p>
<p>Bangladesh - Jwal Rana, 41</p>
<p>    Malaysia     2 Taiwan     0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Che Zambil Ahmad 2, Rusdee Sulong 17</p>
<p>    Standings	  Pl  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Malaysia		 3  2  1  0  4  0    7</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia	   3  2  1  0  6  1    7</p>
<p> Taiwan		   3  1  0  2  3  5    3</p>
<p> Bangladesh	     3  0  0  3  2  9    0</p>
<p>Next matches: March 27 in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia - Taiwan v Malaysia, Saudi Arabia v Bangladesh</p>
